{
  "profile": "message",
  "profile_page": "profiles/message.md",
  "notes": [
    "pair: narrative + supertype Message, each trimmed and folded like the room profile's pairs; is_message is what isMessage must answer.",
    "characters and members: the world every case reads. characters is the world's Characters (id to name), the names a reader shows; members is the members list as GET members returns its rows (the owner's row has id null, matching a created_by of null).",
    "addressed: isAddressedTo(message, character); sent_by: whether narrator is the character.",
    "sender: senderStatus(message, members) is status; a case with members null is a world whose members list the reader cannot read. claimed is the narrator (null: none, shown as from nobody); written_by, on a mismatch, is the author's Character.",
    "mark: readMarkOf(relations, character, members): of the Read relations given, the id of the reader's mark: actor the reader, written by the reader's own hand (the sender rule on actor: verified) or carrying no created_by at all (a folder, an export: no hand to check), the newest updated_at when there are several; null when the reader has none.",
    "order: created_at, and two equal created_at keep the order of the list given (the server's list order).",
    "unread: unreadFor(messages, read_mark) for reader: addressed to the reader, not sent by the reader, not on the mark; as ids in created_at order; read_mark null is a reader with no mark.",
    "thread: every message whose chain of parent_narrative reaches root, the root included, as ids in created_at order.",
    "Every case has a kind and a name; a reader dispatches on kind."
  ],
